# IApartmentState Interface
Provides methods for manipulating apartment state. Apartments are analogous to the COM threading model, called "apartment model," and are used by the common language runtime (CLR) to manage threading and synchronization.  
  
## Methods  
  
|Method|Description|  
|------------|-----------------|  
|[GetApartmentId](iapartmentstate-getapartmentid-method.md)|Gets the ID of the apartment that represents the current instance of the `IApartmentState` interface.|  
  
## Requirements  
 **Platforms:** See [System Requirements](../../get-started/system-requirements.md).  
  
 **Header:** MSCorEE.h  
  
 **.NET Framework Version:** [1.0, 1.1, 2.0, 3.0, 3.5, 4.0, 4.5, 4.5.1, and 4.5.2](../../get-started/net-framework-versions.md)
