# IHostAssemblyManager::GetAssemblyIdentity Method
Gets the common language runtime (CLR) assembly identity for the specified assembly.  
  
## Syntax  
  
```cpp  
HRESULT GetAssemblyIdentity (  
    [in] LPCWSTR  pwzAssemblyFile,  
    [out] LPCWSTR *ppwzFullAssemblyIdentity,  
    [out] LPCWSTR *ppwzSimpleAssemblyIdentity,  
    [out] DWORD    *pdwAssemblyIdentityLength  
);  
```  
  
## Parameters  
 `pwzAssemblyFile`  
 [in] The path to the assembly file.  
  
 `ppwzFullAssemblyIdentity`  
 [out] A pointer to the fully qualified assembly identity string.  
  
 `ppwzSimpleAssemblyIdentity`  
 [out] A pointer to the simple assembly identity string.  
  
 `pdwAssemblyIdentityLength`  
 [out] A pointer to the length, in characters, of the fully qualified--------------------